###  http://www.semanticweb.org/zarif/ontologies/2026/8/untitled-ontology-2#Склад
:Склад rdf:type owl:Class ;
       rdfs:subClassOf :LogisticObject .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/zarif/ontologies/2026/8/untitled-ontology-2#Товар
:Товар rdf:type owl:Class .


